#: scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2feb542eee04fb865b301c13b861905be2c289d3845edb267ef860ef6a4a1a57
#. default-sha256: 9fed35eec68cd6ffbf573357efee5b6ab99579810c65567948da48532f4ec0c5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1E6C256C_B493_478B_9873_8BF3B45AB41F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Without exception, everyone who had wandered into the mansion "
"had lost their lives before the sun rose the next morning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫이 저택에 온 이는 ⟪k:7⟫모두 ⟪k:8⟫동이 트기도 전에 목숨을 잃었습"
"니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12a1346ab954e04ded4bcc530c2085628d0addaf43bb76412fc0d8aa7b2eaf9f
#. default-sha256: 812e43b2f5f0c36b4b793413e361a54f9f6cf0f478579e08a5704f9930cbdcad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C93420F3_8FFA_40B7_B856_1FE1F8A0466F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was the first visitor who had not met this fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇기에 ⟪k:1⟫소녀는 첫 예외가 되었지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ef17d08e3048cbe945c06007bd2bd9ac12d85a5429fc1dddede98754acf6efc
#. default-sha256: 57cafd6cdfa10f3364379f6fd786e565b7ed35b45c45e58c7f68a1db958094bf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CAC6C91A_DD29_4811_9238_F2717385F7F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Over time, Bestia’s madness gradually subsided; ⟪k:1⟫he even began to seem rather tame. ⟪k:2⟫"
"You would hardly believe it was the same beast who had once reveled in those perverse festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫베스티아의 광기는 점차 잠잠해지더니, ⟪k:1⟫얌전할 지경까지 갔습니다. ⟪k:2⟫그토록 일그러진 잔치"
"에 환희하던 짐승 같지 않게요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54eca2ace3f4a453ef979b03256a6a1b8e3fdc55366407dfd1ec411680686f5d
#. default-sha256: d5c78b79aa4d85d2b53b27ca8a3d60a4ceff0d4333e92c71523fcf0029af3d06
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1D47DDF0_66D0_43BB_9984_D2296BE1DCDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was, I imagine, at a loss for how to behave."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫짐승도 ⟪k:1⟫어쩌면 좋을지 갈피를 못 잡던 걸 수 있겠습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a36244c2e7b2acead317eb5cb45df98390b4ade434b70b16744ba46d990b2be4
#. default-sha256: 23623dd57f8f8b45c91d93426c58a6cfe953f883c0e8601361ce2f8afdb0e274
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1FE82314_7A96_4ED8_9B20_9E78C3AB7AA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I too would be flustered in the constant presence of such beauty."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저도 ⟪k:1⟫소녀처럼 아름다운 사람이 가까이 있으면 ⟪k:2⟫동요하고 마니까요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e45a7bc83bb5dfdcbc6d6a635acce8c8cebb160bf2c58dd46ed10c390195c5e7
#. default-sha256: c2eba432b7e15ebc5442a90472bc1887edee1ad8ee4c5c6038113511f1bcdea5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E0F46256_924E_4B46_9D3D_844EE9C51BC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not just her appearance; ⟪k:1⟫she had said she wished to live with him—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫"
"a beast who had committed countless atrocities. ⟪k:4⟫Perplexing indeed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아름다울 뿐만 아니라…… ⟪k:1⟫끔찍한 행위를 자행한 자신과 살고 싶다니, ⟪k:2⟫이상한 일 아니겠는"
"지요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B50B9D3C_4359_45FB_A6A0_304B59FEF526
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 623381214f0e1784841e85da2af93522c619681e06585e28ce8362e91d957157
#. default-sha256: d7cb9fc3b8e93ccfcf62751cf96e39ab41d3cf408d8efafe779ec30172c3803b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B50B9D3C_4359_45FB_A6A0_304B59FEF526"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫…………."

#: scenario2:scenario2_BCBD67FC_A76D_41C8_85A8_CB3C53F9EF2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6633d4fe9e977c18c6a951955af30a4da4fa0e08f4078f393b89fc264b33729c
#. default-sha256: 0093ad05cf238039503367d7553c5c9202cb6d1a9f75565e1cd2f36a783fa698
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_BCBD67FC_A76D_41C8_85A8_CB3C53F9EF2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...What is the matter?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………왜 그러세요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B5BD6D06_AAF2_49FD_BAD8_8B3BA4A5AD55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fda0284802f4940268205598a36bebc6ff005c086f16b91885886ec86da6aba3
#. default-sha256: 2e3642e3c51ed3152ce1dfd5cae74d228c382245ed8606400df93620696199af
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B5BD6D06_AAF2_49FD_BAD8_8B3BA4A5AD55"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you honestly not fear me?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫너………, ⟪k:2⟫정말로 내가 두렵지 않나."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FB16E62F_6D73_4768_AC4F_888E6DAFFCCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57a96ab6ed0bb44107e6db5e0be24137aceff5f32900198dca69860afc99eea5
#. default-sha256: 1d65d2c52c5981e607b3f6a2b7f5267e62cb21796c6a597543d7b1203a42bc3c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FB16E62F_6D73_4768_AC4F_888E6DAFFCCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do I appear to be afraid of you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫제가 당신을 두려워하는 것처럼 보이시나요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_819774A8_0F00_452F_8CA5_49691425E1DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f73c6acb38e27a08de151e1abff54924dcf244ad7601724dc6ab2bed1d76a49
#. default-sha256: c96c7747c00a2f1dd098cbb1a507d235dec0b368080efd88f65f62500ee91f7c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_819774A8_0F00_452F_8CA5_49691425E1DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No... ⟪k:2⟫y-⟪k:3⟫you do not."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아니………. ⟪k:2⟫그, ⟪k:3⟫그렇겐 안 보인다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FA13F74E_6111_4089_8272_900D124FD583
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53b82c8216fb8d931d80a1e179b257b62895f05bbd5c5d593a56c6f3df920462
#. default-sha256: 0db363d875cfc3ba44ce84f176375686387c53f8078c91a1ee3e4c2cfdebb945
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FA13F74E_6111_4089_8272_900D124FD583"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(But you ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫. ⟪k:3⟫If you could see me,⟪k:4⟫you would react the same as everyone "
"else.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You would mock me; ⟪k:7⟫you would despise me;⟪k:8⟫you would want to kill me.)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫두려워할 거다. ⟪k:2⟫내 모습을 보면 ⟪k:3⟫다른 놈들과 똑같아질걸. ⟪k:4⟫나를 혐오"
"하고, ⟪k:5⟫증오하며, ⟪k:6⟫죽이고 싶어질 거다)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ADED7667_51B0_42A8_966B_728429B71DF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b584279a650ba554da0caa42e205070ec5b82979912384d0c94231d77cee3186
#. default-sha256: 808005b85e4272b93fa7da7081cd832b603b24500dc444bd933c6792282d25d8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ADED7667_51B0_42A8_966B_728429B71DF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(You don’t know what I’ve done, because you can’t see.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(장님이라서…… 내가 무슨 짓을 저질렀는지 ⟪k:1⟫모르는 거지)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5FDA6BE2_1924_4963_BEDA_BF537EC984FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1902159d93afc3dff8d665f25c0b4cc2bbd2b4767a3fcd2064d60fbed952fc34
#. default-sha256: 39b412e674462ba8fe3333b75de49c75ea256a442e117834ce0781425c899abb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5FDA6BE2_1924_4963_BEDA_BF537EC984FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I ⟪k:1⟫enjoyed⟪k:2⟫ it.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(나는…… 즐겼다)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_13329D0F_E001_4658_8979_1CED36B9A9DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0112434f17db7e9fcebe50b67d97501709ce32fdb45446ef85bf045773454c0
#. default-sha256: c6a36d43b213f40e9da50f276ea59557ebc0ce8be28a56e6a1ddd8ddc8b33a12
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_13329D0F_E001_4658_8979_1CED36B9A9DC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I basked in their terror.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(공포를 ⟪k:1⟫즐겼다)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_CF810AEE_F1A6_4B2C_8B58_3FFE098C534E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dce35147c6d82542e4b25f7922f00b95ff46b0a5b49e86f21876cd4fa17f89f4
#. default-sha256: 82355756c78f037645b52ebad9334022373597d23334ac22950b67c00750c17a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CF810AEE_F1A6_4B2C_8B58_3FFE098C534E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(So why... ⟪k:1⟫Why do I not want you to find out?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(그런데…… 왜…… ⟪k:1⟫그걸 들키기 ⟪k:2⟫싫은 거지)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B9787E55_09F7_40B2_B99F_E1824044313A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 440831886d3e2dca6d2f6b8602f70b2fd5cd97585cb7336c8c0c512ef7a7bb17
#. default-sha256: a7c94637bd02abaec77eebeb08243b6c33c88e7755a27d9ee852399029f3063e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B9787E55_09F7_40B2_B99F_E1824044313A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(I don’t want you to know how many people I’ve tortured,⟪k:1⟫how many I’ve slaughtered, how "
"much blood I’ve imbibed...)"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫(그래, ⟪k:1⟫들키기 싫다……. ⟪k:2⟫내가 많은 인간을 해치고 ⟪k:3⟫죽여 ⟪k:4⟫생피를 빠는 등……)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_FF7D2F93_0EE1_4904_82BC_CFBF1E4C29EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: abbf90acd4c80eee265f0a76704e783b2fec311fbf9de12c70b6ced253a5eff1
#. default-sha256: 19609fdcf6b75c07e36edb166de768ffd7fe27aa27b6b8f42aa0b11f9555f12c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FF7D2F93_0EE1_4904_82BC_CFBF1E4C29EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(all the horrible things I’ve done.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(얼마나 지독한 행위를 저질렀는지를)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0A61BE1F_38C0_4EDA_BF3F_E5B5FACFAD54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6530c3788c5fa3f5bd104f438a8a919e5cddabc6a7f92ba4af3683fb55351795
#. default-sha256: 76183dcf28cb34d8a406017cdca2b80f89f26744f8e0de31be0aa6bd40995f66
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0A61BE1F_38C0_4EDA_BF3F_E5B5FACFAD54"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(“Horrible”? I’m ⟪k:1⟫aware⟪k:2⟫ that what I’ve done is wrong?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(지독하다――, ⟪k:1⟫지독하다고? ⟪k:2⟫나는 ⟪k:3⟫그걸 자각하는 건가)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_215A2D46_B2AB_4C00_8D11_BCA5D5A8AF86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60953ebcc5c0b5a8b8b388bf5b7df3de9dd5e0efe98677e2ba7fb63387a9701b
#. default-sha256: f47ed6f068a35f938b528790e9a19a514246522c3a66b858736004efc959884b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_215A2D46_B2AB_4C00_8D11_BCA5D5A8AF86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(But I relished in it...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(나는 환희했잖은가………)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B81F4DF4_2CAE_4BFB_9662_057572CF1458
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9a1ace3d5a022086ab1c8abe590dbb2936b8a97f7956fccccd19f5b6a1a9d62
#. default-sha256: d31834e2043d3781dfb5d0a0bc0867682797c42b7c55a4d2915c9d6816fee716
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B81F4DF4_2CAE_4BFB_9662_057572CF1458"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫for so long... ⟪k:2⟫to slaughter them...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(수도 없이……… ⟪k:1⟫죽이고 싶었고………)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5AA9AE97_F7A2_4AFA_A2FD_3B7BBDA70572
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8b8f39a43fff6313ccc29c341f215441cb113d873e642694520f23f60b5d8d2
#. default-sha256: 63a0546d1e37277c28a1309ac8780ea156ae685d3373ed9e7b5eff633847eaeb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5AA9AE97_F7A2_4AFA_A2FD_3B7BBDA70572"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I desperately desired to see blood—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫human blood...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(인간의 피를 보고 싶어 안달이 났잖나………)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D48F470C_5E20_4CC0_84F6_388845B1A72F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5705a7d198ebba9c062f051594c2005ff38dac0de4935a79ccb42d1767ad65e
#. default-sha256: 659d1e83cb62bb18f7101c1559fc47e6ce9e377cdac65f6270d6a1c8fbdefef7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D48F470C_5E20_4CC0_84F6_388845B1A72F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(What is it I crave? Murder? Or laughter?)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(나는 대체 뭐지? ⟪k:1⟫죽이고 싶지? ⟪k:2⟫웃고 싶지?)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_47464B74_3291_424D_B8E6_799F589CED24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e55177d9b22d53c63cb4144460be293a0a5fde68f9c55ae713983c5c53a8d86
#. default-sha256: 260adb8a86e8a3066d1073799eb618cf8894b6f3747af336e5df65346be3e97a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_47464B74_3291_424D_B8E6_799F589CED24"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I said... ⟪k:1⟫that I had no need for peace, yet here I am...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(평온은 ⟪k:1⟫내게 필요치 않은 거라―― 했을 텐데)"

#: scenario2:scenario2_8994C00C_0D88_487E_804B_8DE5B11C8C54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d5f5b6b3842a3eb8cbca839a5b6d728a7b5f71314d1ba3aa905138f1abc0e6ae
#. default-sha256: e4c62793d8e81f18da2e9b81337a74b2fcd045d65efd11d3b0d75f8b5fb930a8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_8994C00C_0D88_487E_804B_8DE5B11C8C54"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Is something the matter?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………왜 그러세요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_D01C2A63_1F68_4FAA_A4F0_1AF90DC52647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d89cac770f0d3bd83919c5639a8e55cb2c178c2fb184f839cbb4f95d6a9f0029
#. default-sha256: 4a785692c9ca140a41acec7adef35bd4154f71a94766dd33de27a18d39f3dd68
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D01C2A63_1F68_4FAA_A4F0_1AF90DC52647"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, ⟪k:2⟫uh, ⟪k:3⟫some tea..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그게, ⟪k:2⟫차를………"

